          "title": "You'll want to know: നിയന്ത്രിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിയന്ത്രിക്കുക — niyantrikkuka — \"to control\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പോലീസ് ആൾക്കൂട്ടത്തെ നിയന്ത്രിച്ചു. pōlīsŭ āḷkkūṭṭatte niyantriccu. The police controlled the crowd."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: നിയന്ത്രിച്ചു, niyantriccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is നിയന്ത്രണം, control."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിയന്ത്രിക്കുക (niyantrikkuka) is built from Sanskrit niyantraṇa, \"restraining, checking, governing\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
