          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വർദ്ധിക്കുക — varddhikkuka — \"to go up; to grow\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നഗരത്തിൽ ചൂട് വർഷം തോറും വർദ്ധിക്കുന്നു. nagarattil cūṭŭ varṣaṁ tōṟuṁ varddhikkunnu. The heat in the city goes up year by year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: വർദ്ധിച്ചു, varddhiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In talk people often say കൂടുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വർദ്ധിക്കുക (varddhikkuka) is built from the Sanskrit root vṛdh, \"to grow\", as in vardhayati, \"makes grow\" (CDIAL 11382), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
