              "text": "ഉയരുക — uyaruka — \"to go higher; to rise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുഴയിലെ വെള്ളം രാത്രി ഉയർന്നു. puḻayile veḷḷaṁ rātri uyarnnu. The water in the river rose in the night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഉയർന്നു, uyarnnu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its past is ഉയർന്നു. The noun ഉയരം, height, is the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
