          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉയരുക (uyaruka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 646 lists Malayalam uyaruka, \"to rise, to be high\", with uyaram, \"height\"."
